    "bodyText": "Call us: (973) 450-1141\n \n \n \nHome\nAbout Us\nHeating & Air Conditioning\nDuctless Units\nIce Machines\nRefrigeration\nHumidifiers & Air Purifiers\nTestimonials\nContact\nModern Technology Delivered by Old Fashioned Service\nFinancing options & emergency services available! \n Professional Heating and Cooling Services with over 30 Years of Experience\nUltra Air is proud to continue providing outstanding service and products to our residential and commercial customers since 1991. From installation of air conditioning, heating and refrigeration systems, to ductless heating and cooling units, air purifiers, humidifiers, seasonal maintenance, and service contracts, we cover all of your HVAC comfort needs!\nRefrigeration services\nNeed a refrigerator installed in your restaurant? We offer refrigeration service to commercial and franchise restaurants. We service walk-in refrigerators and freezers. Follett Ice, Delfield, Norlake, Bev-air, True, Manitowoc Ice Machines, Hosizaki Ice, and Scotsman are just some of the brands we service. We have factory trained technicians. They can help you with any installation or service problems you have!\nOur team\nNot only do we have an experienced, and professional team of technicians, but we also use state-of-the-art equipment. We are up to date on all the latest tools to help finish your project on time, and within budget. We also strive to keep our prices fair by leveraging our experience and relationships with manufacturers to create a streamlined and cost-efficient process. We’re not happy until you're happy!\nFor heating and cooling services call  (973) 450-1141!\nUltra Air\n19 Main Ave.\nClifton, NJ 07014\n(973) 450-1141\nultraair@comcast.net\n \n \n \nBuilt by Vivial  |  Privacy Policy\nShare by:",
