      "bodyText": "Call us: (973) 450-1141\n \n \n \nHome\nAbout Us\nHeating & Air Conditioning\nDuctless Units\nIce Machines\nRefrigeration\nHumidifiers & Air Purifiers\nTestimonials\nContact\nWhether you're looking for installation, repairs, or maintenance for your heating or cooling system, count on us for prompt, affordable and honest service. Our passion is giving you the most comfortable living environment possible. Reach out to Ultra Air in Clifton, NJ today to learn more. We can’t wait to work with you!\nContact information\nUltra Air\n19 Main Ave.\nClifton, NJ 07014\n(973) 450-1141\nultraair@comcast.net\nHours of operation\nMon - Fri\n8:00 am - 4:30 pm\nSat - Sun\nClosed\nEmergency Calls Available Saturday and Sunday\nPayment methods\nWe accept  Visa, MasterCard, Discover, American Express, Cash and Check.\n\n\nFinancing options also available! \nSend us a message\nName:\nEmail:\nPhone:\nMessage:\nUltra Air\n19 Main Ave.\nClifton, NJ 07014\n(973) 450-1141\nultraair@comcast.net\n \n \n \nBuilt by Vivial  |  Privacy Policy\nShare by:",
