      "bodyText": "Call us: (973) 450-1141\n \n \n \nHome\nAbout Us\nHeating & Air Conditioning\nDuctless Units\nIce Machines\nRefrigeration\nHumidifiers & Air Purifiers\nTestimonials\nContact\nExpert Heating and Air Conditioning \nIf you’re looking for experience, don’t look any further. For over 30 years we have been working closely with our suppliers and our customers to create outstanding service. We believe that communication and transparency are crucial to success!\nLicensed professionals\nEstablished in 1991, Ultra Air services the North and Central Jersey area. We are licensed, EPA certified, and carry New Jersey HVAC licenses and certifications. We are also HVACR contractor certified. Our team at Ultra Air Inc are licensed professionals trained to service the residential, commercial and industrial air conditioning, heating, and refrigeration equipment.  \nInstallation and maintenance\nOur featured brands include Mitsubishi Electric, Goodman, Luxaire, Aprilaire, Follett, American Standard and more. We service and repair all brands of ice machines. We offer a range of financing options, and have emergency services available. With our thorough research and attention to detail, we get the job done right. So whether you're looking for installation, repairs, or maintenance for your heating, cooling or refrigeration system, count on us for prompt, affordable and honest service.\nFor heating and air conditioning services call  (973) 450-1141!\nUltra Air\n19 Main Ave.\nClifton, NJ 07014\n(973) 450-1141\nultraair@comcast.net\n \n \n \nBuilt by Vivial  |  Privacy Policy\nShare by:",
